| `tun_read` max = 67 seconds | 🔴 CRITICAL | Process stall; will cause client timeout |
| `obfs_*`, `mux_*`, `full_*` all zero | 🔴 CRITICAL | Dead instrumentation or bypassed stages |
| `active_sessions` counter mismatch (32 vs 1) | 🔴 CRITICAL | Session lifecycle tracking bug |
