### 🥇 #1 — Network I/O Wait Dominates Every Stage (obfs_read_wait)

The decomposition of `obfs_read` into `obfs_read_wait` vs `obfs_read_proc` is extremely revealing:

```
obfs_read       = obfs_read_wait  +  obfs_read_proc
mean:  11,091µs = 11,076µs        +  11µs
                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
                  99.9% of time is blocking on network I/O
```

| Stage | mean_us | p50_us | p95_us | p99_us | max_us |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| obfs_read_wait | 11,076 | 512 | 32,768 | 131,072 | 648,490 |
